and the film "The Marvels"?

00:06:47.834 --> 00:06:50.234
[ Audience oohs ]
-I -- Ooh.

00:06:50.234 --> 00:06:52.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.834
I mean, there are connections.
-Oh.

00:06:54.834 --> 00:06:58.767
-There are -- There are --
some secret, some not so secret.

00:06:58.767 --> 00:06:59.968
-Ooh.

00:06:59.968 --> 00:07:01.667
-Um.
-[ Laughs ]

00:07:01.667 --> 00:07:02.901
I keep saying "ooh"
to everything.

00:07:02.901 --> 00:07:04.000
-Yeah.
-Ooh!

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.968
[ Chuckles ] Ooh!
-I don't know what the --

00:07:05.968 --> 00:07:08.601
what the fans think
the secret connection is.

00:07:08.601 --> 00:07:11.067
-Okay. That's a good --
-I mean...

00:07:11.067 --> 00:07:13.167
-That -- That tells me
that there is no connection.

00:07:13.167 --> 00:07:14.467
[ Laughter ]
-Well...

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:16.434
My -- My other half
is in "The Marvels,"

00:07:16.434 --> 00:07:17.767
and I'm very proud of her.

00:07:17.767 --> 00:07:18.968
-Yeah, so --
-So, there you go.

00:07:18.968 --> 00:07:20.601
-Yeah.
Congratulations.

00:07:20.601 --> 00:07:22.834
-And that's out this weekend.

00:07:22.834 --> 00:07:24.000
But in terms of secret
connections --

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.734
-Has -- Has Miss Minutes...
-Yeah.

00:07:26.734 --> 00:07:29.167
-...been controlling
everything all along?

00:07:29.167 --> 00:07:32.067
[ Audience oohs ]

00:07:32.067 --> 00:07:34.033
-A good question...

00:07:34.033 --> 00:07:36.767
with many answers.
[ Light laughter ]

00:07:36.767 --> 00:07:39.667
I mean...we're all watching out
for A.I., right?

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:42.067
A.I. is --
A.I. is the thing that's coming.

00:07:42.067 --> 00:07:49.033
And as sort of like
a slightly borderline malevolent

00:07:49.033 --> 00:07:51.701
A.I. cartoon clock...

00:07:52.968 --> 00:07:54.434
...watch your back.

00:07:54.434 --> 00:07:57.567
[ Laughter ]
-Ohh! Okay.

00:07:57.567 --> 00:08:01.267
Does "Loki" finale set up
the "Deadpool 3" movie

00:08:01.267 --> 00:08:04.200
