-That's not the question, Tom.

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:14.667 --> 00:08:17.133
-Um.
-Okay.

00:08:17.133 --> 00:08:18.634
-I -- I -- It was a --
