00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.367
soccer team.
[ Light laughter ]

00:08:32.367 --> 00:08:33.534
-No, that's not --
that's not what we asked.

00:08:33.534 --> 00:08:35.033
-We -- We talked about soccer,
