00:08:46.901 --> 00:08:49.501
Tony Stark, aka Iron Man?

00:08:49.501 --> 00:08:53.133
[ Audience oohs ]

00:08:53.133 --> 00:08:54.567
-This guy.

00:08:54.567 --> 00:08:56.734
This is investigative journalism
right here.

00:08:56.734 --> 00:08:58.200
[ Laughter ]
Um.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:04.968
I mean, time slipping
technically gives Loki

00:09:04.968 --> 00:09:07.901
some interesting...
[ Drum roll ]

00:09:07.901 --> 00:09:10.767
...moves he can make.
[ Chuckles ]

00:09:10.767 --> 00:09:14.601
I suppose, yeah, he can move
from past, present, future.

00:09:14.601 --> 00:09:16.868
I know that I can time slip.

00:09:16.868 --> 00:09:20.534
I don't know that other
characters can time slip.

00:09:20.534 --> 00:09:22.767
Speaking for myself,
Loki's died a few times,

00:09:22.767 --> 00:09:24.067
come back -- I'm still here.

00:09:24.067 --> 00:09:26.601
[ Light laughter ]
So I don't know that --

00:09:26.601 --> 00:09:29.434
that death is necessarily --
I mean, death is --

00:09:29.434 --> 00:09:31.567
death is up for grabs
as an existential question.

00:09:31.567 --> 00:09:32.968
[ Laughter ]
[ Drum roll ]

00:09:32.968 --> 00:09:34.801
Um, that's all I can give you.

00:09:34.801 --> 00:09:36.100
-All right.
That's all he can say.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.934
Oh, my goodness.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:09:38.934 --> 00:09:41.501
-He's good.
You can't -- can't break him.

00:09:41.501 --> 00:09:42.567
Can't break the man.

00:09:42.567 --> 00:09:45.501
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

00:09:45.501 --> 00:09:46.868
But, Quest -- Quest, can I --

00:09:46.868 --> 00:09:48.567
can I get another drum roll,
please,

00:09:48.567 --> 00:09:51.934
because this is the first time
we're allowed to show a clip

00:09:51.934 --> 00:09:55.434
from an actor's project
on our show for a long time.

00:09:55.434 --> 00:09:56.601
-Yeah.
[ Drum roll ]

00:09:56.601 --> 00:09:58.834
-We waited.
This is history right here.

00:09:58.834 --> 00:09:59.968
And thank you, again,
for coming back.

00:09:59.968 --> 00:10:01.067
-Thank you for --
-You know we love you.

00:10:01.067 --> 00:10:02.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Thank you.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.467
-Congrats on another
great season of "Loki."

00:10:03.467 --> 00:10:04.701
I want to show a clip.

00:10:04.701 --> 00:10:07.167
Here's Tom Hiddleston
in Season 2 of "Loki."

00:10:07.167 --> 00:10:08.601
Take a look.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:10:08.601 --> 00:10:10.100
-Come on.
They'll have a look at you.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.200
-Where's that?
I need to be back in there.

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:12.601
-No, come on.

00:10:12.601 --> 00:10:14.400
-Mobius, I know you're trying
to help me,

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.133
but we should be dealing
with the bigger problem here --

00:10:16.133 --> 00:10:17.267
He Who Remains.

00:10:17.267 --> 00:10:19.200
-I understand,
and we'll get to that.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:21.133
In order to do to that,
I need a Loki Who Remains.

00:10:21.133 --> 00:10:23.434
We need to address the fact
that you keep disappearing.

00:10:23.434 --> 00:10:25.067
-What? I don't --
I don't keep disappearing.

00:10:25.067 --> 00:10:27.000
We don't have time --
-Loki...

00:10:29.434 --> 00:10:31.434
You just disappeared.
-I know.

00:10:31.434 --> 00:10:33.567
-And I can't keep looking at it
'cause it's horrible.

00:10:33.567 --> 00:10:35.934
-What? I thought you said
it didn't look that bad.

00:10:35.934 --> 00:10:37.767
-I was lying.
It -- It's terrible.

00:10:37.767 --> 00:10:39.601
Looks like you're being born
or dying

00:10:39.601 --> 00:10:40.901
or both at the same time.

00:10:40.901 --> 00:10:42.501
It's really --
It's freaking me out.

00:10:42.501 --> 00:10:43.801
-It's okay. It's okay.
-It looks really painful.

00:10:43.801 --> 00:10:44.934
-It's not that bad.

00:10:44.934 --> 00:10:47.000
I can handle it.
-Come on. How does it look?

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.434
[ Laughter ]

00:10:48.434 --> 00:10:51.100
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Tom Hiddleston, everybody!

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:55.467
"Loki" Season 2
is streaming now on Disney+.

00:10:55.467 --> 00:10:57.567
Brie Larson joins us
after the break.

00:10:57.567 --> 00:10:58.968
Stick around, everybody.
[ Cheers and applause continue ]

